OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition captures life through a
OL,4,Alocal lens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA free exhibit has opened in Grimsby
OL,7,Fshowcasing pictures taken in the area
OL,8,Fby more than 80 local photographers.
OL,10,FThe exhibition, This Place We Share,
OL,11,Fwill feature more than 150 photos of
OL,12,Fthe port town at the Grimsby Fishing
OL,13,FHeritage Centre.
OL,15,FIt will run in the centre's Muriel
OL,16,FBaker gallery until 3 January 2027 and
OL,17,F"celebrates the people, places and
OL,18,Fspaces" of North East Lincolnshire.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
