OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition captures life through a
OL,4,Alocal lens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the council said:
OL,7,F"We're so excited to see all the
OL,8,Fdifferent perspectives they've captured
OL,9,Fand encourage as many people as
OL,10,Fpossible to come down, have a look and
OL,11,Fexplore the rest of the museum while
OL,12,Fyou're there."
